#: 114226892800
msgid "orderTerrain0.1Step1Title"
msgstr "We Need More Gold!"

#: 432712978432
msgid "orderTerrain0.1Step1Description"
msgstr "Bring me 3 Gold Nuggets."

#: 410868545490944
msgid "orderTerrain0.1Step1Thank"
msgstr "Excellent — these nuggets will add nicely to my collection."

#: 4737438277963776
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step1Title"
msgstr "Gleam of Dawn"

#: 4737634734968832
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step1Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Gold Nugget from any gold-bearing rock."

#: 4737870236749824
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step1Thank"
msgstr ""
"Gold holds the glimmer of dawn inside it — if I can’t see it, at least I can "
"feel it..."

#: 4740504523902976
msgid "orderTerrain0.1Step2Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 4740632143990784
msgid "orderTerrain0.1Step2Description"
msgstr "Thanks for the help! I’ll share a curious place with you."

#: 16787486734028800
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step2Title"
msgstr "A New Glasses"

#: 16787574239793152
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step2Description"
msgstr "Bring me 2 Diamonds. They frequently drop from crystal rocks."

#: 16788049915809792
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step2Thank"
msgstr "Let’s see if I’m ready to get used to this land..."

#: 16788621414895616
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step3Title"
msgstr "Getting Used to the Land"

#: 16788663253078016
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step3Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Small Geode. They can be found in ordinary rocks."

#: 16788764000260096
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step3Thank"
msgstr "Let’s see if I’m ready to get used to this land..."

#: 16789247150526464
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step4Title"
msgstr "Dead Man’s Chest"

#: 16789336237543424
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step4Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Chest. A canary might help you find one."

#: 16789441711706112
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step4Thank"
msgstr "So that’s where I left my things..."

#: 16789861523787776
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step5Title"
msgstr "Silver for Tempering"

#: 16790058245033984
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step5Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me 3 Pieces of Silver. They can be found in geodes and ordinary rocks."

#: 16790186938863616
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step6Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 16790822405279744
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step5Thank"
msgstr "This silver pleasantly stings the palms..."

#: 16791339927867392
msgid "orderTerrain1.1Step6Description"
msgstr "Thank you! Stop by my house sometime — here’s the address."

#: 16792386012450816
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step1Title"
msgstr "Ancient Money"

#: 16792448180424704
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step1Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me 4 Ancient Coins. They are often found in ancient pots and vases."

#: 16793192929431552
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step1Thank"
msgstr "Now I can finally give change to the ancients!"

#: 16793381891215360
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step2Title"
msgstr "Ball-Roller"

#: 16793474094600192
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step2Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me a Golden Scarab. They are large beetles that can be found crawling "
"in the bushes."

#: 16793779863556096
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step2Thank"
msgstr "This beetle is a big ball-roller!"

#: 16794392403906560
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step3Title"
msgstr "Stone Bowling"

#: 16794434028179456
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step3Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Medium Geode. It sometimes appears in ordinary rocks."

#: 16794517595492352
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step3Thank"
msgstr "Now I’ll finally be able to roll some balls!"

#: 16794991149191168
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step4Title"
msgstr "Golden Omelette"

#: 16795063073116160
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step4Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me a Golden Egg. Search through the bushes to find a nest containing "
"such eggs."

#: 16795116181393408
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step4Thank"
msgstr "Now, that’s a breakfast for royalty!"

#: 16795705460133888
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step5Title"
msgstr "Lion’s Blood"

#: 16795757985402880
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step5Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Lion Ruby. It can be found in geodes with red crystals."

#: 16795845432446976
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step5Thank"
msgstr "Now I’ll be brave as a lion!"

#: 16797388357505024
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step6Title"
msgstr "Heaven’s Grace"

#: 16797558377811968
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step6Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me a Heavenly Sapphire. It can be found in geodes with blue crystals."

#: 16797646290423808
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step6Thank"
msgstr "The heavens themselves are on my side!"

#: 16798157601247232
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step7Title"
msgstr "Golden toilet"

#: 16798193798090752
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step7Description"
msgstr "Bring me a 9 Gold Nugget from any gold-bearing rock."

#: 16798263801024512
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step7Thank"
msgstr "At last, I can get the restroom fixed!"

#: 16798933543292928
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step8Description"
msgstr ""
"If you want to make wishes — I know a place where stars fall all the time."

#: 16799140129542144
msgid "orderTerrain1.2Step8Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 66701112705024000
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step5Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 66701312781713408
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step5Description"
msgstr "Ice reminds me of Granny... Drop by her cabin too!"

#: 66701713186750464
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step1Description"
msgstr "Bring me 2 Frozen Items from the frozen rocks"

#: 66702356693647360
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step1Title"
msgstr "Ice Cubes"

#: 66702611300483072
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step1Thank"
msgstr "Perfect for my cocktails!"

#: 66705370212990976
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step7Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 66705373262249984
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step7Description"
msgstr ""
"It seems crabs are connected to the Sun Cult — I know where their temple "
"ruins are!"

#: 66705376152125440
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step2Description"
msgstr "Catch an ice crab — its shell is made of Cryolis."

#: 66705379809558528
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step2Title"
msgstr "Crab Metal"

#: 66705384804974592
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step2Thank"
msgstr "Ah, exometal! I love nature's mysteries!"

#: 66706577295933440
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step8Title"
msgstr "Excellent work!"

#: 66706580684931072
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step8Description"
msgstr ""
"The Sun Cult's most valuable treasures are hidden deep within the Labyrinth "
"— I'll show you where!"

#: 66706585684541440
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step2Description"
msgstr "Light 3 torches at the Shrine and steal the Sun Sphere!"

#: 66706589509746688
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step2Title"
msgstr "Best Heater"

#: 66706594945564672
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step2Thank"
msgstr "Yeah, now that's a proper warm-up!"

#: 70714473507717120
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step2Description"
msgstr "Find 2 Silver Nuggets inside ice cubes and warm them."

#: 70714539375067136
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step2Title"
msgstr "Frosty Silver"

#: 70714808414502912
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step2Thank"
msgstr "It's like ice in foil... but backwards..."

#: 70714878748786688
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step3Title"
msgstr "Frosty Gold"

#: 70714919110574080
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step3Thank"
msgstr "Winter gold gets a very special... shine..."

#: 70714983467974656
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step3Description"
msgstr "Find 2 Gold Nuggets inside ice cubes and warm them."

#: 70715014472269824
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step4Title"
msgstr "Invisible Gem"

#: 70715038832787456
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step4Thank"
msgstr "Clear within clear, ahahaha!"

#: 70715070977933312
msgid "orderTerrain2.1Step4Description"
msgstr "Thaw a Medium Diamond. Frozen diamonds are often found in all rocks."

#: 70718769544560640
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step1Title"
msgstr "Grounded Astrology"

#: 70718775819239424
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step1Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me 2 Star Irons. They can be found in the Swamps during a Starfall."

#: 70718777429852160
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step1Thank"
msgstr "Astrometal is any scientist's dream!"

#: 70721195022483456
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step3Title"
msgstr "Cosmic Intruder"

#: 70721197308379136
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step3Description"
msgstr "Find a Cursed Meteor Core during a Starfall and bane the curse."

#: 70721198948352000
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step3Thank"
msgstr "A meteor is a machine, not just a celestial body! Amazing!"

#: 70723998965039104
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step4Title"
msgstr "Crab Warmth"

#: 70724001313849344
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step4Description"
msgstr "Collect 5 Cryolis shards from the shells of ice crabs."

#: 70724003188703232
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step4Thank"
msgstr "Are you also dying to know how crabs live in the snow?"

#: 70724154619854848
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step5Title"
msgstr "New Sensors"

#: 70724156297576448
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step5Description"
msgstr ""
"Bring me 9 Pieces of Silver. They can be found in geodes and simple rocks."

#: 70724162102493184
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step5Thank"
msgstr "My research instruments will finally stop glitching!"

#: 70724346286964736
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step6Title"
msgstr "Crab Warmcoat"

#: 70724348468002816
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step6Description"
msgstr "Collect 8 Cryolis shards from the shells of ice crabs."

#: 70724350279942144
msgid "orderTerrain2.2Step6Thank"
msgstr "Now I will finally understand how they survive the winter!"

#: 70738013825007616
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step1Title"
msgstr "Going Big"

#: 70738018996584448
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step1Description"
msgstr "Bring me a Large Diamond. It can be found in all frozen rocks."

#: 70738021307645952
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step1Thank"
msgstr "Oh my god, it's the size of a head! But whose..."

#: 70738580156710912
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step3Title"
msgstr "Whitelands Treasure"

#: 70738582908174336
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step3Description"
msgstr ""
"Give me the Jarl Chest. The canary will help you find it in the Whitelands."

#: 70738585055657984
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step3Thank"
msgstr "Reminds me of Grandfather..."

#: 70742364090007552
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step4Title"
msgstr "Essence of Flame"

#: 70742368280117248
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step4Description"
msgstr "Extract an Idol Spark from the Sun Sphere."

#: 70742370125611008
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step4Thank"
msgstr "What a hot stone..."

#: 70742532495507456
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step5Title"
msgstr "Iridescent Stone"

#: 70742535381188608
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step5Description"
msgstr "Bring me an Opal. It's a rare find in the frozen rocks."

#: 70742539273502720
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step5Thank"
msgstr "Look how beautifully it shimmers..."

#: 70743768674336768
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step6Title"
msgstr "It Left Offspring!"

#: 70743771123810304
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step6Description"
msgstr "Extract an Owl Chick from the Sun Sphere."

#: 70743772839280640
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step6Thank"
msgstr "The Big Owl brings the cold... Why is the chick so hot?"

#: 70744648739979264
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step7Title"
msgstr "Big Deal"

#: 70744655853518848
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step7Description"
msgstr "Bring me 5 Gold Chunk. They are quite common in the frozen rocks."

#: 70744658739200000
msgid "orderTerrain2.3Step7Thank"
msgstr "Now I'll be the biggest man in the town."
